    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061125.0132\n\nDOHA, Nov. 25 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nDraws for women's table tennis team event of Asian Games\n\n\n\n\nFollowing are the draws for the women 's table tennis team event of the 15th Asian Games here released on Saturday:\n\nGroup A: DPR Korea, Uzbekistan, India\n\nGroup B: China, Hong Kong of China, Vietnam, Kuwait\n\nGroup C: Japan, South Korea, Lebanon, Mongolia\n\nGroup D: Singapore, Thailand, Macau of China, Tajikistan\n\nNote: Top two finishers advance to the next stage. The women's team event of the Doha Asiad is slated from November 29 to December 3.",
